4:["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold mb-4","children":"4. What the Service does"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"Talk to Me Data provides AI agents that work across the tools you use. Depending on your plan, this includes:"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-muted-foreground mb-4","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"General agents"}]," that can read and act on data in tools you connect (for example Gmail, Google Calendar, Google Sheets, Slack, Notion and others), on request or on a schedule you set."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"The Social Media Manager"}],", which analyses public social media data for your accounts and competitors, suggests content, helps you design posts and, if you connect your accounts, publishes them to Instagram, Facebook or TikTok at the time you choose."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"The Property Leads agent"}],", which uses US public property records to help you find potential leads."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Custom agents"}],", which we build for you after a kickoff call. Any extra terms for custom work will be agreed with you in writing."]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"We keep improving the Service, so features may change. If we remove a feature that is a significant part of what you pay for, we will tell you in advance and, if you are on a paid plan, you may cancel and get a pro-rata refund for the rest of your current billing period."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4","children":["Some features may be labelled ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"beta"}]," or ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"preview"}],". They are provided as they are, may change or be removed, and may be less reliable."]}]]}]
5:["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold mb-4","children":"5. Plans, actions and payment"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-muted-foreground mb-4","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Plans."}]," We offer a free Starter plan and paid plans. The current plans, prices and what each one includes (number of agents, monthly actions and other limits) are shown on our pricing and billing pages when you sign up or upgrade."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Actions."}]," Most things an agent does use “actions”, for example a data pull, a tool call or a piece of AI writing. Each plan includes a monthly allowance of actions that resets on the 1st of each calendar month. Unused actions don’t carry over. When you run out, agents pause until the allowance resets or you upgrade. Because the allowance is checked before a task starts, one task in progress may finish slightly over the limit. We won’t charge you for that."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Billing."}]," Paid plans are billed ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"monthly in advance"}]," and ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"renew automatically"}]," each month until you cancel. Payments are taken by our payment provider, Stripe. Prices are in the currency shown at checkout and include or exclude VAT as stated there."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Free trials and promotional offers."}]," If we give you a free month or other offer, we’ll tell you the terms when you claim it, including when paid billing starts and how to cancel before it does."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Failed payments."}]," If a payment fails, we’ll let you know and may retry it. If it still hasn’t been paid after 14 days, we may downgrade your account to the free plan."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Price changes."}]," We may change our prices. We will give you at least ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"30 days’ notice"}]," by email before a new price applies to you. The new price will apply from your next billing period after the notice ends. If you don’t want to pay it, you can cancel before then."]}]]}]]}]
6:["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold mb-4","children":"6. Cancelling"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Anyone can cancel at any time"}]," from the Billing page in the app (via “Manage billing”) or by emailing ",["$","a",null,{"href":"mailto:nas@talktomedata.com","className":"text-foreground underline underline-offset-4","children":"nas@talktomedata.com"}],". Your paid plan stays active until the end of the billing period you’ve paid for, then your account moves to the free plan. We don’t refund part-used billing periods, except as set out in this section or where the law requires it."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Consumers: your 14-day right to cancel."}]," If you are a consumer, you have a legal right to cancel a paid subscription within ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"14 days"}]," of the day you first buy it, without giving a reason. Because the Service starts straight away, when you subscribe you ask us to start providing it during that 14-day period. If you then cancel within the 14 days, we will refund what you paid ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"minus a proportionate amount for the Service provided up to the day you told us you were cancelling"}],". To cancel, email ",["$","a",null,{"href":"mailto:nas@talktomedata.com","className":"text-foreground underline underline-offset-4","children":"nas@talktomedata.com"}]," or use the Billing page. We will refund you within 14 days of your cancellation, using the payment method you used."]}]]}]
